meta {
  name: Latest Notes If Unread
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/latest-unread?entityType=TRUCK&entityId={{truckId}}&n=1
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  entityType: TRUCK
  entityId: {{truckId}}
  n: 1
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  For the Home banner (`NoteResource.getLatestIfUnread`). When the caller has unread notes on the entity
  (someone else added a live note since they last listed or dismissed), returns the newest `n` live notes
  (1 to 20, default 1), newest first, replies included but not nested. Otherwise `data` is `[]`.

  Doesn't mark anything read. To dismiss the banner, call "Mark Notes Read".

  Roles: every torg role except DRIVER. VAHN_ADMIN can't call this (its views aren't tracked).
  400 for a missing/unknown `entityType`, missing `entityId` or `n` out of range; the truck access rules of
  "List Notes" apply.
}
